Jiangxi Hualiu and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c63" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9457">10</ix:nonFraction>% owned by Junpu Jiyuan. Junpu Jiyuan is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c64" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9458">30</ix:nonFraction>% owned by Jiangxi Hualiu.</span></ix:footnote></td>
</tr></table>

