<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of December 31, 2025, the investments in film
relate to a single motion picture, which is expected to be fully liquidated by June 2026. A separate investment in film, included in the
corresponding balance as of June 30, 2025, was liquidated during the six-month period ended December 31, 2025.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 14; Value: 2 --><div>
