<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Depreciation expenses were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9546">47,457</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c13" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9547">36,608</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for
the six months ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p><div>

