<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">On September 8, 2025,&#160;the Company further acquired <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c129" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="cpop:BusinessCombinationAdditionalVotingEquityInterestAcquiredPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9573">1</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest
of Hand in Hand to make Hand in Hand a <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c130" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionPercentageOfVotingInterestsAcquired" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9574">100</ix:nonFraction>% owned subsidiary of the Company. As the acquisition cost for the <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c129" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="cpop:BusinessCombinationAdditionalVotingEquityInterestAcquiredPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9575">1</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest is less
than the net equity value of Hand in hand, it resulted a premium on acquisition of minority interest of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c129" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterest" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9576">24,325</ix:nonFraction>, which was recorded in
additional paid in capital of the consolidated financial statements of the Company.</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-5927"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b><span style="text-decoration:underline">12. OTHER NON-CURRENT ASSETS</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfOtherAssetsNoncurrentTextBlock" id="ixv-5932"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">As of December 31, 2025 and June 30, 2025, other non-current assets
consisted of the following:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
