<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Bank loans represent the amounts due to various
banks. As of December 31, 2025 and June 30, 2025, short-term and long-term bank loans consisted of the following:</p>

