<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Operating leases as lessor</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Heliheng, a subsidiary disposed during the six
months ended December 31, 2025, has entered into lease agreement with a customer for rental of apartments. The leases are fixed payment
and the lease terms are&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseRemainingLeaseTerm" id="ixv-9803">19&#160;years</ix:nonNumeric>.&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="cpop_ScheduleOfOperatingLeasesLessorTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="cpop:ScheduleOfOperatingLeasesLessorTableTextBlock" id="ixv-9804">The Company recognized&#160;the lease payments as revenue in profit or loss over the
lease term on a straight-line basis as below:</ix:nonNumeric></p>




<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

